l": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scrhfl.jpg"}], "slug": "screenbound", "storyline": "Enter the unique world of Screenbound, where your Quantum boy (Qboy) transports you into a weird dual-dimensional space that occupies 5D = 3d + 2d.\n\nSo how the heck did this happen?\nYour mom invented the device and you found it in the garage.\nShe was keeping it secret all this time, and other dark secrets start to come out as you delve deeper.\nYou'll find other stuff too. But let's not spoil the plot.", "summary": "Screenbound is a platformer unlike any other. You move in first-person view at the same time while playing in 2d on the screen of your Qboy. Mind-bending environmental puzzles will force you to test the limits of dimensional space. Your jumping and movements are mirrored - but certain things affect the opposite dimension. Combat is in 2d and you will receive your loot in 3d.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/screenbound", "videos": [{"id": 109993, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "uR2K8InGAus", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uR2K8InGAus", "title": "Screenbound - A game about being distracted (Wishlist now live!)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uR2K8InGAus/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 115258, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "9FoQKnFjrzs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9FoQKnFjrzs", "title": "Screenbound - Official Gameplay Trailer | OTK Games Expo 2024", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9FoQKnFjrzs/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 115911, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "SmAzkkJRars", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SmAzkkJRars", "title": "Screenbound Gameplay Trailer -  Future Games Show Summer Showcase 2024", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SmAzkkJRars/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 116000, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "9bAsU-hss4Q", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9bAsU-hss4Q", "title": "Screenbound trailer - PC Gaming Show 2024", "thumb": "htt